<title>USA: Jabil Circuit sets two-for-one stock split.</title>
<headline>Jabil Circuit sets two-for-one stock split.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PETERSBURG, Fla. 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jabil Circuit Inc said Tuesday it will split its stock two for one through a 100 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>It set July 8 as the record date for the split. The additional shares will be distributed on July 22, it said.</p>
<p>The dividend will increase its common shares outstanding to 36.6 million, 18.3 million currently, the circuit board assemblies maker said.</p>
